sysutils/proc-cli: update to 2.3.0

2.3.0 (2026-11-03):
- One card for a process, the same in on, info, for and why: command,
  directory, user, parent, status, resources, start time, children,
  ports and the connections to them.
- Every process table shows the user, the uptime and the command, and
  ports says whether each port is reachable from the network.
- A value proc cannot read is shown as "-" or left out of the JSON,
  never as a 0 nobody measured.
- JSON gains the parent's name, child count, CPU time and open files of
  each process, and three more statuses (idle, starting, disk_wait).

Full list: https://github.com/yazeed/proc-cli/blob/v2.3.0/CHANGELOG.md
